{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026C5WqsWFNwb1794442865.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>天成控股擬以1供3，供股集資最多約6,000萬元。</p><p></p><p>每股供股價0.463元，較上日收市價折讓逾兩成九，涉及供股股份逾1.29億股。集資所得主要用作海事建築分部，及其他土木工程分部的業務發展及擴展，以及正在磋商的潛在土木工程合約，執行所需的前期按金及初始營運資金。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T01:27:17.615129+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T00:19:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T20:57:31.909408+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T01:20:27.706043+00:00","content_hash":"45e4eb2a42a1e09237db1eec42d0c6e062701b017d18a9eaef832bcd64680076","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T01:27:17.615129+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}